license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wiseman-s/oei-core"
url: "https://wiseman-s.github.io/oei-core/"
abstract: >-
  OEI Core is an open-source integration and validation engine for energy data.
  It maps heterogeneous CSV and JSON energy datasets into a shared schema,
  validates them, records full provenance, and exports harmonised results
  through a Python library, a CLI, and a REST API.
keywords:
  - energy
  - open-data
  - interoperability
  - validation
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
  - digital-public-good
  - kenya